{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32003","headline":"原居即事言怀赠孙员外 · 贾岛","name":"原居即事言怀赠孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出入土门偏，秋深石色泉。\n径通原上草，地接水中莲。\n采菌依余枿，拾薪逢刈田。\n镊撏白发断，兵阻尺书传。\n避路来华省，抄诗上彩牋。\n高斋久不到，犹喜未经年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}